+# -*- coding: utf-8 -*-
+# Copyright (c) 2008-2013 LOGILAB S.A. (Paris, FRANCE).
+# http://www.logilab.fr/ -- mailto:contact@logilab.fr
+#
+# This program is free software; you can redistribute it and/or modify it under
